<title>USA: MBIA says Dunton joins board of directors.</title>
<headline>MBIA says Dunton joins board of directors.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>MBIA Inc said Monday Gary Dunton, president of Family and Business Insurance Group of USF&amp;G Insurance, joined the company's board of directors.</p>
<p>USF&amp;G Insurance is a unit of USF&amp;G Corp.</p>
<p>Dunton has been president of USF&amp;G's Family and Business Group since 1995. He joined the firm in 1992 as executive vice president of Field Operations and Commercial Lines.</p>
<p>--Steven Dickson, 212-859-1652</p>
</text>
